{
  "id": "power_plants___performance_efficiencies",
  "title": "Power Plants - Performance Efficiencies",
  "description": "The performance of a power plant can be expressed through common performance factors including heat rate, thermal efficiency, capacity factor, load factor, economic efficiency, and operational efficiency.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Power Plants - Performance Efficiencies\n\nThe performance of a power plant can be expressed through some common performance factors:\n\n* heat rate (energy efficiency)\n* thermal efficiency\n* capacity factor\n* load factor\n* economic efficiency\n* operational efficiency\n\nEnter the parameters below to calculate the various performance metrics."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "heat_supplied",
          "label": "Heat Supplied to Plant (H)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ",
          "defaultValue": 10000000
        },
        {
          "id": "energy_output",
          "label": "Energy Output from Plant (E)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kWh",
          "defaultValue": 2500
        },
        {
          "id": "average_load",
          "label": "Average Load (Pal)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 2000
        },
        {
          "id": "rated_capacity",
          "label": "Rated Capacity (Prl)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 3000
        },
        {
          "id": "peak_load",
          "label": "Peak Load (Ppl)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 2500
        },
        {
          "id": "production_costs",
          "label": "Production Costs (C)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "EUR",
          "defaultValue": 500
        },
        {
          "id": "potential_energy_output",
          "label": "Potential Energy Output at 100% (E100%)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kWh",
          "defaultValue": 3000
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "heat_rate",
          "label": "Heat Rate (φhr)",
          "formula": "inputs.heat_supplied / inputs.energy_output",
          "unit": "kJ/kWh",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "thermal_efficiency",
          "label": "Thermal Efficiency (μte)",
          "formula": "(100 * 3412.75) / (inputs.heat_supplied / inputs.energy_output)",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "capacity_factor",
          "label": "Capacity Factor (μcf)",
          "formula": "(100 * inputs.average_load) / inputs.rated_capacity",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "load_factor",
          "label": "Load Factor (μlf)",
          "formula": "(100 * inputs.average_load) / inputs.peak_load",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "economic_efficiency",
          "label": "Economic Efficiency (φee)",
          "formula": "inputs.production_costs / inputs.energy_output",
          "unit": "EUR/kWh",
          "format": "currency"
        },
        {
          "id": "operational_efficiency",
          "label": "Operational Efficiency (μoe)",
          "formula": "(100 * inputs.energy_output) / inputs.potential_energy_output",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "options": {
        "type": "bar",
        "title": "Performance Metrics Comparison",
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "Heat Rate\n(kJ/kWh)",
            "Thermal Efficiency\n(%)",
            "Capacity Factor\n(%)",
            "Load Factor\n(%)",
            "Economic Efficiency\n(EUR/kWh)",
            "Operational Efficiency\n(%)"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value"
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "data": [
              "inputs.heat_supplied / inputs.energy_output",
              "(100 * 3412.75) / (inputs.heat_supplied / inputs.energy_output)",
              "(100 * inputs.average_load) / inputs.rated_capacity",
              "(100 * inputs.average_load) / inputs.peak_load",
              "inputs.production_costs / inputs.energy_output",
              "(100 * inputs.energy_output) / inputs.potential_energy_output"
            ],
            "type": "bar",
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#1f77b4"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}